-factory function.
@@ -136,2 +37,0 @@ factory function.
-No ``pytest_funcarg__`` prefix when using @fixture decorator
--------------------------------------------------------------------
@@ -139,3 +38,0 @@ No ``pytest_funcarg__`` prefix when using @fixture decorator
