@@ -206 +58,0 @@ overview of fixture management in your project.
-.. _`funcargscompat`:
@@ -208,2 +59,0 @@ overview of fixture management in your project.
-Conclusion and compatibility notes
----------------------------------------------------------
@@ -211,3 +60,0 @@ Conclusion and compatibility notes
-**funcargs** were originally introduced to pytest-2.0.  In pytest-2.3
-the mechanism was extended and refined and is now described as
-fixtures:
@@ -215,3 +61,0 @@ fixtures:
